# Usually leave this unset: the app calls /api on its own site.
#  - Locally, the Vite dev server forwards /api to http://localhost:5000
#    (change with API_PROXY_TARGET when starting Vite).
#  - On Vercel, /api is served by the serverless function in the same project.
# Only set it if the API lives on a different domain:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
